# Environment variables the console may rotate in the secrets file.
#
# Only variables that are genuinely per-source API keys. Never list
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD, MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD, SESSION_SECRET or CONTROL_TOKEN:
# rotating those from a web form would let one compromised session take the
# platform apart, and they are rare enough to do by hand.
#
# Install to /etc/ops-control/keyvars.allow, owned by root, mode 0644.

DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY
WDPA_API_KEY
IUCN_API_KEY
GEONAMES_USERNAME
OPENTOPOGRAPHY_API_KEY
GFW_API_KEY
